msgid "A calibration is already running. Finish it before starting another."
msgstr "En kalibrering kører allerede. Afslut den, før du starter en ny."

#: website/templates/calibration.html:162
msgid "The feeder is offline. Check that it is powered on and connected, then try again."
msgstr "Foderautomaten er offline. Kontrollér, at den er tændt og forbundet, og prøv igen."

#: website/templates/calibration.html:167
msgid "The feeder is busy. Wait until it is idle, then try again."
msgstr "Foderautomaten er optaget. Vent, til den er ledig, og prøv igen."

#: website/templates/calibration.html:228
msgid "Couldn’t reach the feeder. Check the connection and try again."
msgstr "Kunne ikke få forbindelse til foderautomaten. Tjek forbindelsen, og prøv igen."

#: website/templates/calibration.html:238
msgid "Enter the dispensed weight in grams to continue."
msgstr "Indtast den udleverede vægt i gram for at fortsætte."

#: website/templates/calibration.html:259
msgid "Just now"
msgstr "Lige nu"

#: website/templates/calibration.html:268
msgid "Couldn’t save the calibration. Try again."
msgstr "Kalibreringen kunne ikke gemmes. Prøv igen."

